  "summary": "Dylan O'Rae is a 5-foot-7, 160-pound left-handed hitting shortstop/second baseman/outfielder known for his elite contact skills and plus-plus speed. He excels at controlling the strike zone, leading to a high on-base percentage and numerous stolen bases. His primary challenge is his well below-average raw power, with a swing geared towards ground balls. He projects as a high-contact, high on-base threat, likely settling at second base or center field due to fringe-average arm strength. He missed the 2025 season due to wrist surgery, but appears to be back in action in 2026.",
